==Format==
This is a European tournament on servers in Europe.<br />
Players will get a minimum of 7 games each, and more if you advance to playoffs.
*'''Groupstage: Preliminary round'''
**Groups of 4 players each group. 3 games each. Players was seeded into seeding pots and randomly drawn into groups.
**The top 2 players in each group goes to Division 1, the bottom 2 goes to Division 2.<br /> <br> 
*'''Divisions: Round 2'''
**Groups of 5 players each group. 4 games each.
**The top 2 players each group to Playoff A and players #3 and #4 each group to Playoff B.<br /> <br>
*'''Tiebreakers group and division games'''
**1. Wins
**2. Mapscore (+/-)
**3. H2H game(s)
**4. Map wins
**5. Frags internal games
**6. Frags all games
**7. Rematch<br /><br />
*'''Playoffs'''
**Playoffs are Double Elimination
**Winner of LB needs to win twice in Grand Finals to be champion

